assert {
  res.status: in [200, 401, 404]
}

docs {
  Where can I see "my offers" as a Booking.com-style activity tab?
  The spec only documents:
  - POST /offers (submit)
  - PATCH /offers/{id} (accept/decline)
  - POST /offers/{id}/counter

  There is NO `GET /offers/mine`, NO `GET /offers/{id}`, NO way to
  list everything I've offered on. I have to track offers via
  notifications only. That's missing.

  Trying anyway — expecting 404.
}
